{
  "name": "grid-subgrid-zero-terminal-track-start-and-end",
  "kind": "spec",
  "features": [
    "grid",
    "subgrid",
    "intrinsic-sizing"
  ],
  "spec": [
    "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-grid-2/#subgrid-margins"
  ],
  "derivation": "The parent rows40 and0 have a10px gap. Row-subgrid padding3 leaves a44px whole content span, starting at y3 and ending47. The final zero track nevertheless starts at the parent interior line50 (local47). A20px start-aligned item in that track starts at50, not47; a spanning stretched item remains44px tall. Nested padding2 consumes each outer edge again without moving the interior line: nested spanning height40 at y5; nested terminal item still starts50. The inherited track must retain independent raw start and end even when the residual breadth is negative.",
